{
  "comment": "Glyph sets (docs/GLYPHS.md section 3): per family, the SVG of each physical control, named as PadControl in layer/sys/src/input_bindings.cpp (kPadNames), plus prompt-only names (diagonals, whole D-pad). A family takes the `shared` blocks it lists in `use`, in order, then its own `controls` (later entries win). `absent` lists the controls its pad does not have. Faces are by position: on a Switch pad `south` is the button printed B. Edit, then run tools/make_glyphs.py.",
  "shared": {
    "common": {
      "left_stick": "common/stick-l.svg",
      "right_stick": "common/stick-r.svg",
      "left_x": "common/stick-l.svg",
